        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 12:13",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And when they were come, they say unto him, Master, we know that thou art true, and carest for no man: for thou regardest not the person of men, but teachest the way of God in truth: Is it lawful to give tribute to Cæsar, or not?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 12:14",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall we give, or shall we not give? But he, knowing their hypocrisy, said unto them, Why tempt ye me? bring me a penny, that I may see it.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 90,
            "end": 95,
            "text": "TG Test."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 136,
            "end": 139
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Test.",
            "prettyString": "TG Test",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
